# DS5002: an explicit column of the wrong type.
mode: check
schema: t(customerId: string, month: datetime, revenue: real, n: long)
---- query
from t
| render timechart with (xcolumn = customerId)
---- expected
error[DS5002]: `timechart` needs a `datetime` column for the x-axis, but `customerId` is a `string`
  --> query:2:36
  |
2 | | render timechart with (xcolumn = customerId)
  |                                    ^^^^^^^^^^ this column is a `string`
  |
  = note: the result's columns: customerId: string, month: datetime, revenue: real, n: long
